<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent">Reliable care, organized around you</span><h1>Your Home Deserves the Best Care.</h1><p class="lead">From everyday repairs to complete home maintenance, discover trusted professionals and manage your home services effortlessly with FixMitra.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-lg" href="/book">Book a Service</a><a class="button button-lg button-ghost" href="/services">Explore Services</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span><b>✓</b> Structured requests</span><span><b>✓</b> Transparent quotations</span><span><b>✓</b> Status tracking</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="/images/hero-technician.webp" alt="Professional technician servicing an air conditioner in a modern home" width="768" height="620" fetchpriority="high"><div class="floating-card"><span class="status-dot"></span><div><small>Sample booking status</small><strong>Technician Assigned</strong><span>AC Servicing · Demo</span></div></div><div class="hero-badge"><strong>8</strong><span>service<br>categories</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="trust-stats"><div class="container stats-row"><div><strong>500+</strong><span>Demo service requests</span></div><div><strong>50+</strong><span>Demo professionals</span></div><div><strong>8</strong><span>Service categories</span></div><div><strong>4.9/5</strong><span>Demonstration metric</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Professional home care</span><h2>Popular services, thoughtfully delivered</h2><p>Find the right specialist, understand the starting price and submit a detailed request in minutes.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/services">View all services →</a></div><div class="service-grid"><% services.forEach(service=>{ %><%- include('partials/service-card',{service}) %><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section id="how-it-works" class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="center-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Simple from start to finish</span><h2>How FixMitra works</h2><p>One organized workflow keeps every request clear and traceable.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span>01</span><div class="step-icon">⌕</div><h3>Choose your service</h3><p>Explore categories, inclusions and illustrative starting prices.</p></div><div class="step"><span>02</span><div class="step-icon">✎</div><h3>Submit your request</h3><p>Describe the issue, address and preferred appointment.</p></div><div class="step"><span>03</span><div class="step-icon">◇</div><h3>Receive assistance</h3><p>An administrator reviews, quotes and assigns a professional.</p></div><div class="step"><span>04</span><div class="step-icon">✓</div><h3>Track your service</h3><p>Follow status, quotation and assignment updates securely.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div class="split-visual"><img src="/images/service-maintenance.webp" alt="Professional home maintenance service" loading="lazy" width="700" height="560"><div class="quote-card"><small>Illustrative quotation</small><strong><%= h.formatINR(1249) %></strong><span>Labour + materials · not a payment receipt</span></div></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Why choose FixMitra</span><h2>Confidence in every service request</h2><p class="lead-small">FixMitra replaces scattered calls and uncertain follow-ups with one professional, transparent workflow.</p><div class="feature-list"><div><span>✓</span><div><h3>Professional network</h3><p>Administrator-managed profiles, specializations and availability.</p></div></div><div><span>₹</span><div><h3>Transparent quotations</h3><p>Clear labour, material, additional-charge and discount breakdowns.</p></div></div><div><span>◷</span><div><h3>Convenient scheduling</h3><p>Choose your preferred date and time with a structured request.</p></div></div><div><span>↻</span><div><h3>Organized tracking</h3><p>Follow every status transition with a complete timeline.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-navy"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading light"><div><span class="eyebrow">Demonstration profiles</span><h2>Meet sample service professionals</h2><p>Fictional technician records shown for product demonstration.</p></div></div><div class="tech-cards"><% techs.forEach(t=>{ %><article class="tech-card"><img src="<%= t.image %>" alt="Demonstration technician profile" width="80" height="80"><div><span class="demo-label">Demo profile</span><h3><%= t.name %></h3><p><%= t.specialization %></p><span><%= t.experience %> years illustrative experience</span></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="center-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Demonstration feedback</span><h2>A preview of the customer experience</h2><p>These fictional sample reviews are clearly labelled and do not represent verified real-world claims.</p></div><div class="testimonial-grid"><% if(reviews.length){reviews.forEach(r=>{ %><article class="testimonial"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“<%= r.comment %>”</p><div><strong><%= r.is_demo?'Fictional demo customer':r.name %></strong><span><%= r.service_name %> · <%= r.is_demo?'Demo review':'Customer review' %></span></div></article><% })}else{ %><article class="testimonial"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The booking flow was simple and the service status was easy to follow.”</p><div><strong>Fictional demo customer</strong><span>AC Servicing · Demo review</span></div></article><article class="testimonial"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The quotation breakdown made every charge clear before the work started.”</p><div><strong>Fictional demo customer</strong><span>Plumbing · Demo review</span></div></article><article class="testimonial"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“A polished and organized way to manage everyday home maintenance.”</p><div><strong>Fictional demo customer</strong><span>Maintenance · Demo review</span></div></article><% } %></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container faq-wrap"><div><span class="eyebrow">Helpful answers</span><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p>Everything you need to know before creating a service request.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Contact support →</a></div><div class="accordion"><details open><summary>Is a submitted booking immediately confirmed?</summary><p>No. New requests begin with the status “New.” An administrator reviews the details before confirming or assigning a technician.</p></details><details><summary>Are the displayed prices final?</summary><p>No. Prices are illustrative starting points. Your quotation can vary based on the work, labour and materials required.</p></details><details><summary>How can I follow my request?</summary><p>Use your booking reference and registered mobile number on the Track Booking page, or sign in to your customer dashboard.</p></details><details><summary>Does FixMitra process payments?</summary><p>No payment gateway is configured. Quotations are estimates and are never represented as collected revenue or payment receipts.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container cta"><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent">Ready when your home needs care</span><h2>Start a professional service request today.</h2><p>Clear details. Transparent next steps. One organized place to track progress.</p></div><a class="button button-lg button-light" href="/book">Book a Service</a></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
